OL,3,GNEWSATown's fishermen honoured with
OL,4,Abronze sculpture
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new memorial celebrating generations
OL,7,Fof fishermen has been created following
OL,8,Fa four-year community fundraising
OL,9,Fcampaign.
OL,11,FThe unveiling on Saturday marks the
OL,12,Fcompletion of the #70,000 project to
OL,13,Fhonour St Ives' maritime heritage.
OL,15,FCreated by Cornish sculptor Tom Leaper,
OL,16,Fthe life-size bronze sculpture shows
OL,17,Ftwo fishermen sitting opposite each
OL,18,Fother as they work on their nets.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
