OL,3,GNEWSATown's fishermen honoured with
OL,4,Abronze sculpture
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe idea for the memorial was first put
OL,7,Fforward by members of the local fishing
OL,8,Fcommunity, who approached Leaper about
OL,9,Fcreating a lasting tribute to St Ives'
OL,10,Fseafaring past.
